# Skills that a tool embeds and installs into ~/.copilot/skills/ itself.
#
# One skill per line: `<name> <installer command>`. `#` comments and blank
# lines are ignored.
#
# These are neither ours nor external roots: the tool writes real files and
# its own `skills list` checks them against what it embeds. `script/sync-copilot
# import` skips them so dotfiles never becomes their source.

blackbird          gh blackbird skills install
blackbird-fileset  gh blackbird skills install
agent-retro        gh agent-retro skills install
